=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/d73f2a851c2a72483c1185b7139c5788.webp?t=1761391966\" width=42 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/f153f6b026dc0f0ef41595c1c6088bd2.poster.avif?t=1761391966\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/f153f6b026dc0f0ef41595c1c6088bd2.webm?t=1761391966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/f153f6b026dc0f0ef41595c1c6088bd2.mp4?t=1761391966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/8b9e26453c01319ba1a8016f3e57f885.webp?t=1761391966\" width=346 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And with an outstretched hand the pitiable flesh was rendered still and placid.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your harvesting grows more frenzied, the dull ambling flesh whispers and grows afraid. Make use of new <strong>Dread Abilities</strong> that give you an unnatural advantage in keeping the town placated and making stubborn townsfolk more compliant. You'll need them to overcome terrified neighbors, hushed rumors, animal guardians and hated iron sigils meant to ward you off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430550/extras/d73f2a851c2a72483c1185b7139c5788.webp?t=1761391966\" width=42 h